WEBVTT

00:18.330 --> 00:19.290
No way.

00:19.290 --> 00:20.950
I can't take it off.

00:21.790 --> 00:23.120
What's going on?

00:23.120 --> 00:24.580
I have an unpleasant feeling.

00:25.210 --> 00:25.790
Urin...

00:28.670 --> 00:32.420
Wait, did you see that butterfly?
It's a really rare kind!

00:32.880 --> 00:34.840
Let's capture one for those collectors.

00:34.840 --> 00:38.930
It might be worth more than ten poisonous snakes.
We could get a lot of money for it.

00:41.180 --> 00:43.430
Those things don't matter.

00:43.430 --> 00:44.480
I have to find Urin.

00:46.060 --> 00:48.440
Oh, you're right. Sorry.

00:48.440 --> 00:49.110
Marin.

01:08.290 --> 01:10.840
kimi to ireba

01:08.290 --> 01:10.840
If I’m with you -

01:10.840 --> 01:13.670
kimi to itara

01:10.840 --> 01:13.670
because I’m with you -

01:13.670 --> 01:18.300
kokoro ga yasuraku

01:13.670 --> 01:18.300
my heart is at ease.

01:19.260 --> 01:21.850
kimi mo soude

01:19.260 --> 01:21.850
Surely, you’re the same.

01:21.850 --> 01:27.400
kimi mo ima yasurakerute

01:21.850 --> 01:27.400
You’re at ease now, too.

01:28.440 --> 01:35.030
itekuretara ii noni

01:28.440 --> 01:35.030
If you can just admit it,

01:36.780 --> 01:40.370
sono mama

01:36.780 --> 01:40.370
for even time to forget us,

01:41.330 --> 01:54.510
jikan saemo wasuresouna kurai shizen dakara

01:41.330 --> 01:54.510
it’s only natural, at this rate.

01:55.260 --> 02:05.980
yubisaki kara koboreochiru violet wo yo

01:55.260 --> 02:05.980
Violet drops, falling slowly from our fingertips…

02:05.980 --> 02:12.860
chiisana yume egaite yukou

02:05.980 --> 02:12.860
“Let us follow that small dream with a smile!”

02:12.860 --> 02:18.780
futaride sasayaka na

02:12.860 --> 02:18.780
And just like that, we are happy

02:20.200 --> 02:24.410
kotoba ga ureshii

02:20.200 --> 02:24.410
over such trifling words

02:24.910 --> 02:29.120
somatteku sora

02:24.910 --> 02:29.120
that paint the sky.

02:45.260 --> 02:51.100
The Falling Hearts

02:49.140 --> 02:50.100
Are you crying?

02:52.520 --> 02:59.240
Mom only loves the baby. She doesn't play with me.

02:59.240 --> 03:01.530
It's all the baby's fault!

03:02.200 --> 03:05.620
It would be better if he hadn't been born. I hate him.

03:07.750 --> 03:08.620
You hate him?

03:08.620 --> 03:11.000
I really hate him. I really, <i>really</i> hate him!

03:11.370 --> 03:12.880
I wish he'd disappear.

03:15.170 --> 03:21.380
I hate Mom, too. She doesn't even care about me.

03:21.380 --> 03:26.510
She doesn't even care about me.

03:27.470 --> 03:30.890
Urin! Urin!

03:30.890 --> 03:33.730
Urin, I love you!

03:44.740 --> 03:46.490
There you are!

03:46.490 --> 03:47.870
Thank goodness.

03:47.870 --> 03:49.330
Mom...

03:49.330 --> 03:50.790
I've been looking all over for you!

03:52.960 --> 03:54.580
Mom!

03:54.580 --> 03:58.000
You sure know how to make people worry.

03:58.000 --> 03:59.760
I'm sorry!

04:00.090 --> 04:02.090
Don't run away anymore.

04:18.980 --> 04:20.900
He said he's worried about his sister.

04:23.610 --> 04:24.360
Thank you.

04:25.280 --> 04:26.530
All right, let's go home.

04:26.530 --> 04:26.990
Okay.

04:30.870 --> 04:34.920
Sky people sure are self-centered.

04:44.280 --> 04:46.590
It really turned completely black.

04:46.590 --> 04:49.140
Is the Priestess of the Sky going to be all right?

04:50.010 --> 04:55.350
Kanon is fine. She hasn't been afraid of the dark since she was little.

04:56.480 --> 05:01.970
Not afraid of the dark... As expected from someone born with an evil soul.

05:02.940 --> 05:06.240
Perhaps the one who is afraid of the dark is actually the light?

05:06.700 --> 05:09.370
No, no, that's not possible.

05:13.040 --> 05:14.750
Um, are you all right?

05:15.290 --> 05:19.210
It's so dark and scary. Urin...

05:22.250 --> 05:25.170
Beautiful things, beautiful hearts...

05:25.800 --> 05:29.180
The beautiful sky, the beautiful sea...

05:29.180 --> 05:31.600
Everything fell into darkness.

05:32.100 --> 05:35.600
From the start, Urin didn't want to come to the Sky.

05:36.140 --> 05:39.020
Urin didn't even want to leave the Sea.

05:39.520 --> 05:42.400
Urin only wants to be with you.

05:42.400 --> 05:44.940
Urin won't come back like this, will she?

05:44.940 --> 05:46.360
What are you talking about?

05:46.360 --> 05:49.030
She hates me, right?

05:49.030 --> 05:50.740
How is that possible?

05:51.280 --> 05:55.700
Who made us turn out like this?

05:55.700 --> 05:56.660
That's mean.

05:57.080 --> 06:00.630
Marin, what's wrong? This isn't like you.

06:00.630 --> 06:02.880
Give Urin back to me.

06:02.880 --> 06:06.260
Who was it? I won't forgive them.

06:07.170 --> 06:08.550
It's unforgivable!

06:08.930 --> 06:09.760
Marin...

06:32.370 --> 06:34.240
How long has it been now?

06:34.490 --> 06:36.330
It's been 10 minutes, right?

06:36.790 --> 06:39.000
Isn't it usually only 5 or 6 minutes?

06:39.370 --> 06:40.580
It's been too long, hasn't it?

06:40.580 --> 06:43.500
It should be ending soon, right?

06:44.710 --> 06:46.010
Huh? What's that?

06:48.300 --> 06:49.380
Butterflies?

07:00.690 --> 07:03.150
Those are really rare.

07:03.150 --> 07:05.770
If sold to collectors, they'll fetch a high price!

07:06.400 --> 07:09.650
Up to 20 poisonous snakes. No, 50!

07:10.450 --> 07:13.530
No, it could even be 100 snakes!

07:16.660 --> 07:18.080
I sense evil from those.

07:21.870 --> 07:23.960
100 poisonous snakes just flew away...

07:30.090 --> 07:33.260
A servant of Sedona... That's not good.

07:33.260 --> 07:36.470
Your evil soul has been targeted.

07:36.470 --> 07:37.310
What?

07:42.940 --> 07:44.860
This is not good. Run away!

07:44.860 --> 07:45.400
Okay!

07:49.110 --> 07:52.450
I... I don't have an evil aura!

08:00.700 --> 08:03.040
What is this?

08:13.720 --> 08:15.640
Oh! She appeared!

08:15.640 --> 08:18.600
The Priestess of the Sea and the Priestess of the Sky.

08:21.060 --> 08:21.810
Marin.

08:21.810 --> 08:23.520
Are you one of Sedona's servants?

08:25.440 --> 08:26.440
Unforgivable.

08:28.820 --> 08:30.820
I will seal you away right now,

08:31.320 --> 08:33.320
using the power of the Priestess of the Sea.

08:38.280 --> 08:39.450
I can't transform into a priestess.

08:40.870 --> 08:43.210
Never mind me. How come Marin...

08:43.830 --> 08:44.620
I don't know.

08:45.250 --> 08:46.630
Is it an effect of the eclipse?

08:48.790 --> 08:49.880
Anyway, let's run for now.

09:25.540 --> 09:26.540
Why?

09:27.900 --> 09:29.960
Why can't I transform into a priestess?

09:29.960 --> 09:33.050
If I could transform, that person...

10:03.580 --> 10:08.500
The strong wind is unable to control the raging sea.

10:08.500 --> 10:13.220
The shadow is unable to shine above itself.

10:18.760 --> 10:22.550
Why is darkness born?

10:24.090 --> 10:29.190
Where is darkness born from?

10:31.650 --> 10:33.020
I wonder why.

10:33.520 --> 10:36.780
Listening to this song makes my mind feel calm.

10:37.860 --> 10:40.740
It felt so painful just now.

10:41.700 --> 10:45.740
This song brightens the darkness inside me.

10:46.750 --> 10:52.710
Urin. Right now, I only want to hear Urin's voice.

10:52.710 --> 10:55.170
I only want to see Urin's smile.

11:25.240 --> 11:27.160
We transformed into priestesses.

11:34.790 --> 11:38.170
When light has freed itself from the darkness...

11:45.410 --> 11:50.850
Right now, we are reporting live on the eclipse at Amamiko Island.

11:52.190 --> 11:53.850
This eclipse was really long.

11:54.230 --> 11:57.110
Those butterflies... After the eclipse ended, they disappeared.

11:57.610 --> 11:59.030
What was that?

12:01.570 --> 12:02.110
Hey!

12:04.360 --> 12:05.820
What?

12:07.080 --> 12:09.370
No... It's nothing.

12:09.700 --> 12:12.210
Really. They all get in the way.

12:12.500 --> 12:15.080
Everyone has such idiotic faces.

12:17.250 --> 12:19.250
I won't eat dinner.

12:23.010 --> 12:25.590
Kojima-kun!

12:28.720 --> 12:31.980
Hurry up, Miyako-san. I am worried about the priestesses.

12:31.980 --> 12:32.480
Okay!

12:36.980 --> 12:37.610
Kanon.

12:49.910 --> 12:51.330
Being a Turtle sure is convenient.

12:52.580 --> 12:54.080
You didn't hurt your shell, right?!

12:55.790 --> 12:57.830
My shell is hard!

12:58.540 --> 13:02.050
It seems the Priestess of the Sky was not devoured by darkness.

13:02.760 --> 13:04.380
I don't have time for that.

13:04.970 --> 13:06.050
That's great.

13:06.970 --> 13:09.300
Thanks for the hard work, Priestess of the Sea.

13:09.930 --> 13:12.270
Um, that's...

13:14.060 --> 13:14.810
What's wrong?

13:15.190 --> 13:16.600
Actually, I...

13:16.600 --> 13:19.650
That aside, have you seen Urin?

13:19.650 --> 13:22.110
Oh, I forgot.

13:22.480 --> 13:26.320
There are a lot of people. Is it possible she got lost?

13:26.660 --> 13:28.490
Let's check at the police station.

13:28.490 --> 13:30.910
Oh, yeah. That's a good idea.

13:31.280 --> 13:34.830
I'll go. You guys head home first.

13:34.830 --> 13:36.460
Maybe she went back by herself.

13:36.960 --> 13:37.790
Urin!

13:42.250 --> 13:43.170
Urin!

13:47.380 --> 13:50.720
Urin... Urin, I'm sorry.

13:51.050 --> 13:52.850
I'm sorry I left you by yourself.

13:52.850 --> 13:56.520
Even though I have a job as a priestess,

13:56.520 --> 13:58.190
I'm still your sister,

13:58.190 --> 14:01.270
so I won't leave you alone anymore.

14:01.690 --> 14:04.940
That's great. Everyone is tired, right?

14:05.360 --> 14:08.360
You all must be hungry, as well.
Let's go home and rest.

14:08.570 --> 14:09.450
Yeah.

14:10.370 --> 14:11.950
Let's go, Urin.

14:19.080 --> 14:19.710
Huh?

14:27.860 --> 14:31.390
We earned a lot today. Let's rest through the afternoon.

14:41.100 --> 14:42.770
It's delicious, isn't it, Urin?

14:46.110 --> 14:49.030
All that darkness was a little scary,

14:49.030 --> 14:51.320
but it's all right now.

14:53.620 --> 14:56.500
So what happened, Priestess of the Sea?

14:59.000 --> 15:02.250
About that... It was me who

15:02.250 --> 15:04.290
couldn't transform into a priestess.

15:06.630 --> 15:07.590
What?!

15:07.590 --> 15:09.510
But it's all right now.

15:09.720 --> 15:11.970
Yeah, we were able to transform successfully.

15:12.590 --> 15:15.350
After listening to that song, the power returned to me.

15:15.640 --> 15:19.310
Song? I didn't hear anything like that.

15:19.770 --> 15:22.400
Maybe because the eclipse just ended.

15:22.400 --> 15:24.690
Hm... That is possible.

15:25.150 --> 15:28.860
But I don't know where Sedona's servant went.

15:30.740 --> 15:32.740
Sedona's servant, huh?

15:33.530 --> 15:37.360
I saw her today. She seemed familiar.

15:38.120 --> 15:40.460
No, maybe I'm just imagining things.

15:44.130 --> 15:46.920
I told you, turn off your cell phone while eating.

15:46.920 --> 15:48.170
You're not my dad.

15:50.220 --> 15:51.010
Suzuki?

15:51.300 --> 15:52.380
Where are you right now?

15:53.010 --> 15:53.970
At home.

15:53.970 --> 15:55.510
Turn on the television.

15:55.510 --> 15:56.760
The television?

16:00.100 --> 16:02.440
Because of this, people from all over the world...

16:02.440 --> 16:03.650
Suzuki...

16:03.650 --> 16:06.150
What? Your friend?

16:06.610 --> 16:08.780
Huh? A photograph?

16:09.790 --> 16:10.800
Sheesh.

16:10.780 --> 16:13.110
Regarding this miracle, astronomers...

16:15.240 --> 16:20.080
I took it. Yes, yes, I'll send it to you. Bye.

16:22.120 --> 16:23.580
What is she doing?

16:26.040 --> 16:31.210
Actually, during this eclipse, something mysterious happened.

16:31.780 --> 16:33.220
I saw it myself.

16:33.220 --> 16:33.760
That was...

16:38.510 --> 16:40.060
It's Kojima-kun.

16:41.680 --> 16:42.600
Kojima?!

16:44.900 --> 16:45.850
He left.

16:47.310 --> 16:50.690
What's this? He looks like an indecisive guy.

16:50.690 --> 16:52.320
This guy named Kojima.

16:56.740 --> 16:59.160
Little sister, where did it go?

16:59.160 --> 17:02.200
The Priestess of the Sky's ring.

17:02.200 --> 17:03.410
Lost it.

17:05.080 --> 17:06.120
Sorry.

17:06.370 --> 17:10.210
It's all right. I threw it into the sea, after all.

17:10.210 --> 17:13.630
Without that thing, I won't be evil.

17:13.630 --> 17:14.380
But...

17:14.720 --> 17:16.130
It's really all right.

17:16.720 --> 17:18.010
I'm full.

17:39.570 --> 17:41.620
I don't even know myself.

17:41.620 --> 17:43.750
Why did I have that kind of feeling?

17:44.330 --> 17:46.750
Why did I say such rude things?

17:46.750 --> 17:52.380
Maybe the effect of the darkness was too much for your 100% purity.

17:52.880 --> 17:59.180
Maybe it was because an evil Priestess of the Sky can co-exist with the darkness.

17:59.970 --> 18:01.300
With the darkness...

18:01.760 --> 18:06.480
Maybe today, instead of worrying about the Priestess of the Sky,

18:06.480 --> 18:10.440
I should worry about you, Priestess of the Sea.

18:10.440 --> 18:14.030
I don't ever want that kind of feeling again.

18:14.570 --> 18:15.940
I don't know what to do.

18:16.490 --> 18:18.700
I don't know either.

18:19.160 --> 18:22.950
Nothing like this has ever happened before.

18:23.620 --> 18:28.750
But letting your sister go back to the Sea for now is the best choice.

18:29.170 --> 18:29.920
Why?!

18:30.250 --> 18:34.340
You and your sister contain the power of the Priestess of the Sea.

18:34.960 --> 18:40.340
I don't know when she can help you,
but she's still too young right now.

18:40.340 --> 18:42.890
She doesn't have any power yet.

18:43.140 --> 18:45.020
Yes, but...

18:45.560 --> 18:48.690
You guys already tried your best to fulfill your job as priestesses.

18:48.690 --> 18:51.150
You don't have the time to take care of your sister.

18:51.690 --> 18:55.650
You should just ask Warin and Sam to take care of her.

18:55.650 --> 18:58.360
I can't leave Urin alone!

18:58.360 --> 19:01.910
We've been together the whole time. I don't want to!

19:01.910 --> 19:03.120
But...

19:03.330 --> 19:05.620
No! I want to be with Urin!

19:05.910 --> 19:07.040
Please, Elder.

19:09.410 --> 19:13.000
Then, you have to carefully watch your sister.

19:13.010 --> 19:15.800
When the work increases, I won't be able to help.

19:15.800 --> 19:18.210
Thank you, Elder.

20:06.810 --> 20:07.930
You are?

20:09.060 --> 20:12.980
Denying and rejecting Sedona's power...

20:14.440 --> 20:16.150
Who are you?

20:18.730 --> 20:19.570
I am...

20:27.530 --> 20:31.040
Since you don't want that power, I'll take it.

20:32.500 --> 20:33.250
Urin!

20:35.540 --> 20:36.840
What happened?

20:37.210 --> 20:38.090
Nothing.

20:39.300 --> 20:41.170
I will protect Urin.

20:42.010 --> 20:43.260
I'm all right.

20:44.930 --> 20:48.050
I can protect myself now.

20:48.970 --> 20:50.970
I have power now, too.

20:51.310 --> 20:52.310
Power?

20:52.770 --> 20:55.480
So I will go back to the Sea.

20:56.310 --> 20:58.440
Return? By yourself?

20:58.440 --> 20:59.020
Yes.

20:59.610 --> 21:02.860
No, Urin! I want to be with you!

21:03.950 --> 21:06.910
I already hate being in the Sky.

21:06.910 --> 21:10.290
I can't stand being with Sky people.

21:11.580 --> 21:14.620
It's all because of Kanon.

21:15.460 --> 21:19.040
If Kanon was not here, it wouldn't have turned out like this.

21:20.250 --> 21:22.920
I'm sorry, Onee-chan. See you later.

21:26.930 --> 21:29.800
Wait, Urin! Urin!

21:33.020 --> 21:33.730
Urin!

21:36.980 --> 21:38.020
She disappeared?

21:40.660 --> 21:42.190
Urin...

21:56.870 --> 22:01.250
To turn light into darkness.

22:10.220 --> 22:11.550
Goodbye.

22:26.530 --> 22:31.450
hikari no yurikago

22:26.530 --> 22:31.450
Within a droplet of water,

22:31.870 --> 22:34.990
shizuku no naka ni

22:31.870 --> 22:34.990
a cradle of light

22:35.330 --> 22:38.250
tojikometara

22:35.330 --> 22:38.250
is trapped.

22:38.250 --> 22:43.420
mizu no iro ni naru

22:38.250 --> 22:43.420
And so, it colors the water.

22:43.840 --> 22:47.050
mimi wo sumashite

22:43.840 --> 22:47.050
Clear your ears

22:47.050 --> 22:49.720
eien e

22:47.050 --> 22:49.630
to eternity.

22:49.720 --> 22:55.010
hitori de yume no ato

22:49.800 --> 22:55.010
Beyond a lonely dream,

22:55.010 --> 23:00.350
tsunaide yukeba

22:55.010 --> 23:00.350
if one connects with another,

23:01.060 --> 23:06.940
sotto kurikaesu kagayaki

23:01.060 --> 23:06.940
the repeating, soft shine

23:07.360 --> 23:11.990
warattemo attete

23:07.360 --> 23:11.990
meets and smiles,

23:11.990 --> 23:19.160
mou sukoshide kokoro ga todoku kara

23:11.990 --> 23:19.160
and with just a little more, the hearts have been reached.

23:19.160 --> 23:23.880
toumeina inori de

23:19.160 --> 23:23.750
With a transparent prayer,

23:23.880 --> 23:33.220
yasashiikuchikamu wo tsutsumuyo

23:23.880 --> 23:33.220
concealed within a gentle mouth.

23:35.850 --> 23:36.640
Did you know?

23:36.640 --> 23:38.980
When a dolphin sleeps, half of its brain is still awake.

23:38.980 --> 23:40.100
To protect itself at all times.

23:40.100 --> 23:40.980
That's cute, huh?

23:40.980 --> 23:42.480
Like this. Wink.

23:42.480 --> 23:44.020
That's not cute at all.

23:44.020 --> 23:45.440
Next time, Episode 7:

23:45.650 --> 23:47.110
The Separating Hearts.

23:47.410 --> 23:49.370
I love everyone!
